<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>You're Invited!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #1E2A44;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 42px;
        font-family: 'Mellira', 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
        font-weight: normal;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .content p {
        margin: 0 0 1em 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .invitation-body {
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
        color: #333;
    }
    .invitation-body .names {
        font-size: 1.6em;
        margin: 25px 0;
        line-height: 1.4;
        font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
        font-style: italic;
        color: #1E2A44;
    }
    .invitation-body .names .and {
        font-size: 0.7em;
        font-style: normal;
        color: #555;
    }
    .invitation-body .location {
        font-size: 1.1em;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
    .invitation-body .address {
        font-size: 0.95em;
        color: #555;
    }
    .separator {
        border: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .rsvp-details {
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .rsvp-details strong {
        font-size: 1.2em;
        color: #1E2A44;
    }
    .rsvp-link {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #1E2A44;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
    .disclaimer {
        font-size: 0.8em;
        color: #888888;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding-top: 15px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        text-align: left;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888888;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Veronica & Bishoy</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p style="text-align: left;">Dear <%= guestName %>,</p>
      
      <div class="invitation-body">
        <p>The honour of your presence<br>is requested at the marriage of</p>
        <p class="names">
          Veronica Kwok<br>
          <span class="and">and</span><br>
          Bishoy Awad
        </p>
        <p>
          on<br><strong>Friday, the 3rd of October, 2025</strong><br>at twelve o’clock in the afternoon
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
          at<br>
          <span class="location">Schloss Schönhausen – Festsaal</span><br>
          <span class="address">Tschaikowskistraße 1, 13156 Berlin</span>
        </p>
        
        <hr class="separator" style="width: 40%; margin: 25px auto;">

        <p>
          A reception will follow at<br>
          <span class="location">Ermelerhaus</span><br>
          <span class="address">Märkisches Ufer 10, 10179 Berlin</span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">An evening of fine dining and celebration awaits.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rsvp-details">
        <p>Kindly reply by <strong>10.09.2025</strong> via our wedding website.</p>
        <p>Your personal access code is: <strong><%= accessCode %></strong></p>
        <p><a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="rsvp-link">Click here to RSVP</a></p>
      </div>
      
      <% if (inviteGroup === 'bridesmaids' || inviteGroup === 'groomsmen') { %>
        <p style="margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;">As a member of the <%= inviteGroup %>, you have access to a special page with more details. Please be sure to check the "<%= inviteGroup.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + inviteGroup.slice(1) %>" page on the website regularly for updates.</p>
      <% } %>

      <p class="disclaimer">
        If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out by replying to this email. We look forward to celebrating with you!<br><br>Warmly,<br>Veronica & Bishoy
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>&copy; 2025 Veronica & Bishoy. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
